<title>USA: Granville okays merger with Triangle.</title>
<headline>Granville okays merger with Triangle.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triangle Bancorp Inc said on Friday that  Granville United Bank shareholders approved a $10.3 million stock swap merger with Triangle.</p>
<p>Granville will be merged into Triangle Bank in a deal expected to be completed October 24, 1996, Triangle said.</p>
<p>Triangle will issue 750,000 shares for all of Granville reported total assets of $60 million, Triangle said. Both banks are based in North Carolina.</p>
</text>
